# QGUARD HELIX — Migration Planner: Complete UX/UI Redesign, Workflow Refactoring & Backend Integration Audit

**Target Page:** http://localhost:3000/dashboard/migration-planner

## Objective

Kindly perform a comprehensive review, refactoring, and redesign of the QGUARD HELIX Migration Planner.

The goal is to transform the existing Migration Planner into an intuitive, professional, enterprise-grade Post-Quantum Cryptography (PQC) Migration Management Platform where users can easily understand:

1. What vulnerable cryptographic assets have been detected in their environment.
2. Why each asset is considered vulnerable and what security risks it presents.
3. Which assets should be prioritized for migration.
4. What cryptographic algorithms or configurations should replace the existing vulnerable implementations.
5. What actions and technical steps are required to migrate each asset properly.
6. How users can execute, validate, and monitor their migration progress.
7. Whether their environment has successfully transitioned to quantum-resistant cryptography.

The experience should guide users from vulnerability discovery to successful PQC migration, even if they do not have extensive cryptographic expertise.

